  "kind": "gf-retail-type41-parent-contact",
  "notes": ["The normal paid parent publishes role 3 in both lists. Two publication visits hold the declared root before testing the stationary contact.","Incoming controls construct the separate key-4 type-9 projectile from Sasuke. His body stays outside its and the bomb's radii; no fighter HP is removed.","The original terminal parent bucket is isolated from the incoming projectile's bucket. Actual outgoing and zero-HP branches are distinct, and the Remote command takes priority over both.","For outgoing hits the retained parent pair completes before the child's pair. A per-pass reset preserves the first token; the child uses its own token and amount row.","Only a disposable calculator fork clears receiver +0x6CA. The retained sequence observes tier one after the parent hit and uses that tier's actual child amount.","Declared roots, one stationary receiver and an empty stage grid are not live moving-body collision or native gameplay evidence."],
